            {
                "entry_id": "1d1599c0-2ac3-3da9-bcfc-f1c17f60c522",
                "word": "flétrissement",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "479fc975-c54f-4b42-8670-4cf1dd2f9267",
                        "entry_id": "1d1599c0-2ac3-3da9-bcfc-f1c17f60c522",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "flétrissements"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d85b21ed-caec-31e5-a20b-8403982ff5a2",
                        "entry_id": "1d1599c0-2ac3-3da9-bcfc-f1c17f60c522",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Perte de rigidité des parties non-ligneuses d’une plante."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6fd10c79-5fbe-4152-8552-09e6dc1fb4ba",
                                "sense_id": "d85b21ed-caec-31e5-a20b-8403982ff5a2",
                                "text": "La plante peut donc souffir un certain temps du manque d'eau, donner des signes de flétrissement, puis retrouver une vitalité normale si la teneur en eau augmente à nouveau (pluie, irrigation)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d202a53c-4fd4-4630-801f-da8b09287b15",
                                "sense_id": "d85b21ed-caec-31e5-a20b-8403982ff5a2",
                                "text": "La quantité d’eau comprise entre la capacité au champ et la point de flétrissement permanent est considérée comme étant la quantité d’eau utilisable, autrement dit la quantité d’eau qui est susceptible d’être prévelée par la plante."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ddeec24a-376a-36ab-ad09-594ca4961b9d",
                        "entry_id": "1d1599c0-2ac3-3da9-bcfc-f1c17f60c522",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action de se flétrir, de perdre sa consistance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "58ca0a0c-0890-4e88-85f0-64f41ebe966e",
                                "sense_id": "ddeec24a-376a-36ab-ad09-594ca4961b9d",
                                "text": "Si donc le corset ne peut pas atteindre la pointe du sternum, il est impossible qu’il soutienne les seins. Mais ne peut-on pas les soutenir à l’aide d’une brassière ?… Je crois que ce moyen sera toujours préférable à ceux employés jusqu’alors. Le fait d’emprisonner les seins dans un tissu imperméable favorise le flétrissement et l’atrophie de la glande. Mettez donc des brassières si cela est nécessaire, mais neuf fois sur dix, il n’en sera pas besoin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac14a059-daec-4042-b6c5-d393e793a35f",
                                "sense_id": "ddeec24a-376a-36ab-ad09-594ca4961b9d",
                                "text": "Les phénomènes qui s’accomplissent chez les cholériques, l’altération du sang rendue si évidente par la tentative de la saignée, l’amaigrissement, les crampes, le flétrissement des yeux, la cyanose, la suspension du pouls et de la sécrétion des urines, m’avaient, dès mes premières observations qui datent de l’année 1832, porté à penser que les déjections devaient provenir du sang et contenir du sérum, sous une forme quelconque."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d5c1f199-7e21-39c7-8d87-48a228d65199",
                        "entry_id": "1d1599c0-2ac3-3da9-bcfc-f1c17f60c522",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Altération de caractéristique comme la beauté, la fraîcheur, la joie, le bonheur…"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fcc4a36-cab6-40fe-b6cd-7eafe6ba6bec",
                                "sense_id": "d5c1f199-7e21-39c7-8d87-48a228d65199",
                                "text": "Un rais de soleil brusque, en éblouissant les yeux de Daniel, fit reparaître l’antithèse : la stagnation cérébrale des temporisateurs, le flétrissement avant terme, la minéralisation de rêves toujours plus immobiles, toujours moins vivaces…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8186353-dcbe-49a1-a7b4-9504ef77cfb5",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d1599c0-2ac3-3da9-bcfc-f1c17f60c522",
                        "target_lang_word": "withering",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "withering",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cddb24e2-0eaa-393a-b44a-d0d9066f6931",
                                        "entry_id": "7542852f-4866-3cdb-adf6-a051b603b5ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tending to destroy, devastate, overwhelm, or cause complete destruction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f893d34-bbc4-4500-b7ec-886c671224f9",
                                                "sense_id": "cddb24e2-0eaa-393a-b44a-d0d9066f6931",
                                                "text": "The D-Day troops came under withering fire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6fd1736-a57b-41ab-b435-5b67fc70c2e4",
                                                "sense_id": "cddb24e2-0eaa-393a-b44a-d0d9066f6931",
                                                "text": "Before the clearing had been half crossed the Arabs opened up a withering fire from behind the palisade."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39890818-31a7-43d7-aef7-08af0bf8efc2",
                                                "sense_id": "cddb24e2-0eaa-393a-b44a-d0d9066f6931",
                                                "text": "Shockingly, under such a withering combined barrage, the Japanese destroyer promptly exploded and sank in short order, before even having had a chance to unleash her Long Lances. First blood to the USN!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a78e64fb-7e08-3b61-b7b5-ea035007239c",
                                        "entry_id": "7542852f-4866-3cdb-adf6-a051b603b5ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Diminishing rapidly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94b843d7-5d0c-4858-8009-16d1d0b23e53",
                                                "sense_id": "a78e64fb-7e08-3b61-b7b5-ea035007239c",
                                                "text": "The playboy seemed oblivious to his withering fortune as he continued in his decadent lifestyle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de1818ba-1ee2-4d8e-bb91-d4fc7844c1a2",
                                                "sense_id": "a78e64fb-7e08-3b61-b7b5-ea035007239c",
                                                "text": "Go—ask of nature in thy walk.\nThe rose-bud, dying on its stalk,\nThe fading grass—the withering tree,\nAre emblems of thy fate and thee."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "221aa5b6-9525-38f3-b9a5-13b655dbca15",
                                        "entry_id": "7542852f-4866-3cdb-adf6-a051b603b5ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tending to make someone feel small; scornful in a mortifying way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c284ebd0-ca92-4ea6-8011-9d9a523a5ab1",
                                                "sense_id": "221aa5b6-9525-38f3-b9a5-13b655dbca15",
                                                "text": "He made withering remarks about his adversary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "487e4f04-4564-4d36-98a3-290b0775a1fb",
                                                "sense_id": "221aa5b6-9525-38f3-b9a5-13b655dbca15",
                                                "text": "Jane's mother in law gave her a withering look."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07a6bb9f-fd37-41b1-93f9-8e7284af6134",
                                                "sense_id": "221aa5b6-9525-38f3-b9a5-13b655dbca15",
                                                "text": "It is a very serious thing that there be Worlds and Suns, and yet most withering is the laughter of Māna-Yood-Sushāī. And when he arises from resting at the Last, and laughs at us for playing with Worlds and Suns, We will hastily put them behind us, and there shall be Worlds no more."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "660221e1-033e-4dfd-969b-250426bd87b8",
                                                "sense_id": "221aa5b6-9525-38f3-b9a5-13b655dbca15",
                                                "text": "The chief executives of Amazon, Apple, Google and Facebook, four tech giants worth nearly $5 trillion combined, faced withering questions from Republican and Democratic lawmakers alike on Wednesday for the tactics and market dominance that had made their enterprises successful."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
